Hermes Agent specifics (cheat sheet)
Skills live at ~/.hermes/skills/<category>/<skill-name>/SKILL.md
SKILL.md = YAML frontmatter (name, description, version, optional metadata.hermes.tags/category/requires_toolsets/config) + markdown body with "## When to Use" and "## Procedure"
Agent auto-creates skills via skill_manage(action='create', name='...', content='...') after complex workflows
Memory: ~/.hermes/memories/MEMORY.md (2200 chars) + USER.md (1375 chars)
Session storage: ~/.hermes/state.db (SQLite + FTS5)
MCP config in ~/.hermes/config.yaml under mcp_servers key
Cron via Hermes jobs.json with natural-language scheduling
Install: curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent/main/scripts/install.sh | bash
CLI: hermes, hermes model, hermes gateway, hermes setup, hermes mcp add/install/configure, /reload-mcp
Python 3.11+ required, uses uv
